Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Braving the Maze
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,These colorful Bulala are so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be born from these plants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they all come together suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they want to stick with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,numbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must remember that these Bulalas are dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The gray Bulala, you will be electrocuted if you touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The different colors of Bulala produced here have different characteristics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And little Bulala will be attracted to ones of the same color
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When gathered together, they will become larger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So that little gray Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.23,0:00:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then did it fly to Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He even ate it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, please avoid it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.31,0:01:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.15,0:01:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hurry up. It’s very windy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too hard to hide while walking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Why always blocking the road? Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that you can pass like this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,These flowers don’t look dangerous, so let me charge first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So itchy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.43,0:01:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I won
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells so spicy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, what about
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not a quitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re out thanks to Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels a little strange here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t go first this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go first this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the paint on the tree
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.22,0:02:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowy, is there any news about my Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. But I have sent drones into the rifts to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.93,0:02:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition, I also set up surveillance cameras around the rifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,An alarm will sound whenever there is any movement
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The alarm is coming soon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? So fast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The alarm went off. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll investigate and analyze it right now. I’ll tell you the news right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to go to Goats’ Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wake up, Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me just now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who opened the way, but then you suddenly started dancing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it’s the sap that makes people dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, don’t touch anything with wicker
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s squat and walk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay, just a little tired
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,not good
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.14,0:03:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,where are you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we back here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I realize that they look exactly the same everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,lost
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do? It’s so scary here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,where did everyone go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, is Daddy back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.15,0:04:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know yet, so let’s go to Goats’ Village now to see what’s going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful stone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, follow quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, look at this stone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,go away
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what is that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally found someone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to go alone anymore. It’s too scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s go together
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But what should we do if we are separated again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That’ll be no problem
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you try to explain to him that you didn’t abandon him back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, back then
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, back then
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Teardrop Bulala. If we touch it, it will make our whole body wet and heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving will also become difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for saving me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,stop talking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s walk carefully next
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, the weird Bulala is here again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there one in front?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s getting closer here too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn we’re surrounded
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, let’s go here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way just now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll wait for you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, come back soon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it is fire
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then use water to deal with it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,what this tree looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I always feel like this place is familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,who
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,fine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,have you found a way out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No. every place looks the same
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,like a maze
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think these trees look like trees around your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it looks exactly like the forest outside my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just find these trees with weird postures
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow their longest branches
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,See it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie and I used to pick mushrooms in the forest and play hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m very familiar with this terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go bring them out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Which side is Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, go this way
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect that my son, you have such a good sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Daddy, he often comes to take me to play hide-and-seek and pick mushrooms
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the way
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, actually I didn’t leave you behind back then
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m really trying to think of a way to save you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I always believed in you back then
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you said that to me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.57,0:10:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t look for you again in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you sealed the hole we dug together
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:10:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you seal that hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I think the hole is sealed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I thought you were blaming me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who sealed that hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting to Your Majesty, we have just uncovered an assassin’s plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,assassin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The cave was sealed by Keyan and Ketian
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned out to be a misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You are here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit is over here. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s keep moving forward
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s keep moving forward
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember that Wolffy often came to the gate to catch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.18,0:11:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time Weslie stepped forward and beat him away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know where they are now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Wolnie and Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They are running this way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,where
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
